{#-
  Renders the "## Execution graph" section. Inputs:
    graph  — dict[str, list[str]] step → deps, insertion order preserved
    waves  — list[list[str]] resolved wave order (parallel members per wave)
  Emits a mermaid flowchart (one edge line per dep, isolated nodes as bare ids)
  followed by a numbered wave list ("∥"-joined members share a wave).
-#}
{%- set depended = [] -%}
{%- for step, deps in graph.items() -%}
{%- for dep in deps -%}
{%- if dep not in depended -%}{{ depended.append(dep) or "" }}{%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{%- endfor -%}
